note Lane 4: visor_evidence tests (fixtures + read-only pass over the real
note evidence/ tree). Pure seeded OM-2 port of tests/visor/test_visor_evidence.c,
note every C check in the same order. Run from the repo root. Prints "PASS n/n".
note Built after visor.om and visor_evidence.om (mk/visor-verify.mk).

